{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":16.08},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.2,"end":36.24},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":38.08,"end":49.68}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":5.28,"text":"廣度優先搜尋把已發現的格子放進先進先出佇列。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6,"end":8.4,"text":"發現格子時立即標記，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.52,"end":10.16,"text":"可避免重複加入。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.2,"end":13.52,"text":"搜尋前緣逐層擴張，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":13.84,"end":16.08,"text":"每一層比起點多一步。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.2,"end":18.48,"text":"使用開放迷宮，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.88,"end":21.68,"text":"播放或拖曳時間軸。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.08,"end":25.92,"text":"比較早期附近格子和後期遠處格子；"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":26.56,"end":28.48,"text":"畫面顯示發現順序，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":28.8,"end":30.88,"text":"沒有逐格前驅指標。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":32.8,"end":36.24,"text":"哪個佇列規則產生廣度優先的層次？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":38.08,"end":41.68,"text":"哪個佇列規則產生廣度優先的層次？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":42.88,"end":46.48,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":46.96,"end":49.68,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}